    "secondaryGap": "Single source (wikipron isl_latn_broad, human) — LARGE. No kaikki isl / epitran committed. The consonant + vowel maps are the standard Icelandic phonology (Árnason 2011 / Wikipedia); ASPIRATION (the phonemic pre/post-aspiration) + vowel LENGTH are folded in run 1 → the segment skeleton is compared.",
    "folds": [
        { "pattern": "ː", "replace": "", "note": "vowel LENGTH: syllable-quantity-conditioned (a stressed vowel is long in an open syllable) — the Germanic weight rule, deferred → strip ː on both sides" },
