        { "pattern": "⁽", "replace": "", "note": "the referee marks OPTIONAL preaspiration on the epenthetic-cluster stop with superscript parens ⁽ʰ⁾ (Örn→œrt⁽ʰ⁾n); strip the paren (the ʰ inside is already folded)" },
